# The original's velocity test matched no unit, so it changed nothing; the curated version changes moving Arm and Core units
left only field units/*.fbi [unitinfo] maxdamage: *
left only field units/*.fbi [unitinfo] maxvelocity: *
left only field units/*.fbi [unitinfo] turnrate: *
left only field units/*.fbi [unitinfo] brakerate: *
left only field units/*.fbi [unitinfo] acceleration: *
